{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13111300","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111300","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1311130001:1":{"text":"请原谅侍者们的失礼。它们很少见外客，对外界过于警惕。","source_cn":"请原谅侍者们的失礼。它们很少见外客，对外界过于警惕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDD3427D62F0ACF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311130002:1":{"text":"多谢你们的礼物，它如此贵重……我无法拒绝。","source_cn":"多谢你们的礼物，它如此贵重……我无法拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F29207163976E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311130003:1":{"text":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","source_cn":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8978DEE295CD5358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1311130003":{"text":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","source_cn":"我想，你们一定有必须见我的理由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8978DEE295CD5358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311130004:1":{"text":"你比我想象的还要年轻……你、你这么早就成为了亡灵？","source_cn":"你比我想象的还要年轻……你、你这么早就成为了亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FC7FDEB8433C566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":